/*---------------------------------------------------------------------------*\
  new_components_c309 -- the 41 components DEV.md 4c C309 (slice 3 of
  C287) added to the catalogue, loaded and exercised.  Written by
  `bin/curate/c287_new_components.py case`.
  Tc and Pc come from the IUPAC critical-property series where it recommends
  them, else from the archive's measurements, else from Joback (marked, per
  value); the ideal-gas Cp and dHf_298 are Joback for every one.
  1. REPRODUCTION.  One `estimateComponent` per component with the Joback
     groups its record declares (groups.joback): the run prints the Joback
     Tb, Tc, Pc (a record whose Tc or Pc is IUPAC or measured does not carry
     these: they are printed beside it, for comparison), the ideal-gas Cp,
     dHf_298 and dGf_298 (s_298 = (dHf - dGf)/298.15 + the elements' CODATA
     standard entropies).  A liquid Cp estimated by Rowlinson-Bondi uses
     that Cp_ig.
  2. SMOKE TEST.  One `propertyScan1D` per component, 300-340 K at 1 bar:
     the vapour pressure (the Antoine its vp case promoted), the liquid
     heat capacity and the liquid density.  Every value must evaluate;
     outside a fitted range the engine announces the extrapolation, and
     every autoPromoted value is voiced on the console and in the caveat
     block.
\*---------------------------------------------------------------------------*/

